  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Accountability: A Pathway to Strengthened Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme focuses on three key outputs - 1, enhanced reseach and advocary capacities 2. strengthening instituational capacities for governance engagement and 3. citizen particiaption in local policy processes.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tr&#xf3;caire&#x2019;s approach to delivering the accountability component under the Twiyubakire programme aims to enhance efficient, effective, and accountable policy responses and service delivery at the local level. This aligns with the programme&#x2019;s goal of strengthening CSO and non-state actor capacities for meaningful participation in governance and accountability processes.</narrative>
  </description>
